(footprint "C_Rect_L18.0mm_W9.0mm_P5.00mm_P15.00mm_MultiPitch"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "hand")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Film capacitor, two lead pitches on one footprint: 5.00mm and 15.00mm, both centred at x=7.5. Body envelope 18*9mm reserved for the larger part. Drawn for C_in1/C_in2 on the subxo sub-crossover board, where the choice between a 220nF/2u2-NP-electrolytic (5.00mm) and a real 2u2 film part (15.00mm) is deliberately left open until the listening test. Same-number pads share a net, so the 5mm and 15mm pairs may both be present in copper; only the pad1-to-pad2 gap needs isolation, and that is 3.0mm at the tighter pitch -- clear for a 0.8mm laser gap or a 1.2mm endmill channel.")
	(tags "C Rect film multipitch 5.00mm 15.00mm Capacitor")
